1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:02,700
It is a truth universally acknowledged

2
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:06,660
that a single man in possession of a
good fortune must be in want of a wife

3
00:00:07,360 --> 00:00:11,280
However little known the feelings or
views of such a man may be on his first

4
00:00:11,280 --> 00:00:12,430
entering a neighbourhood

5
00:00:12,430 --> 00:00:16,050
this truth is so well fixed in the
minds of the surrounding families

6
00:00:16,690 --> 00:00:20,260
that he is considered as the rightful
property of some one or other of their

7
00:00:20,260 --> 00:00:21,260
daughters

8
00:00:21,740 --> 00:00:22,840
My dear Mr. Bennet

9
00:00:23,840 --> 00:00:25,390
said his lady to him one day

10
00:00:26,310 --> 00:00:29,230
have you heard that Netherfield
Park is let at last?

11
00:00:30,630 --> 00:00:32,730
Mr. Bennet replied that he had not

12
00:00:33,430 --> 00:00:34,700
But it is

13
00:00:35,570 --> 00:00:36,570
returned she

14
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:39,050
for Mrs. Long has just been here

15
00:00:39,050 --> 00:00:40,750
and she told me all about it

16
00:00:41,730 --> 00:00:43,370
Mr. Bennet made no answer

17
00:00:44,420 --> 00:00:46,580
Do not you want to know who has taken it?

18
00:00:47,590 --> 00:00:49,490
cried his wife impatiently

19
00:00:50,340 --> 00:00:51,560
You want to tell me

20
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:53,380
and I have no objection to hearing it

21
00:00:54,120 --> 00:00:55,770
This was invitation enough

22
00:00:56,410 --> 00:00:57,470
Why my dear

23
00:00:57,690 --> 00:00:58,690
you must know

24
00:00:58,690 --> 00:01:03,890
Mrs. Long says that Netherfield is taken
by a young man of large fortune from the

25
00:01:03,890 --> 00:01:04,890
north of England

26
00:01:05,320 --> 00:01:08,480
that he came down on Monday in a
chaise and four to see the place

27
00:01:08,480 --> 00:01:10,500
and was so much delighted with it

28
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:12,640
that he agreed with Mr. Morris immediately

29
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:16,119
that he is to take possession
before Michaelmas and some of

30
00:01:16,119 --> 00:01:17,602
his servants are to be in

31
00:01:17,602 --> 00:01:19,580
the house by the end of next week

32
00:01:20,390 --> 00:01:21,730
What is his name?

33
00:01:22,670 --> 00:01:23,670
Bingley

34
00:01:24,200 --> 00:01:25,800
Is he married or single?

35
00:01:26,720 --> 00:01:29,240
Oh single my dear to be sure!

36
00:01:30,070 --> 00:01:31,770
A single man of large fortune

37
00:01:31,970 --> 00:01:34,070
four or five thousand a year

38
00:01:34,750 --> 00:01:37,190
What a fine thing for our girls!

39
00:01:38,130 --> 00:01:39,250
How so?

40
00:01:39,340 --> 00:01:40,420
how can it affect them?

41
00:01:41,300 --> 00:01:42,400
My dear Mr. Bennet

42
00:01:43,310 --> 00:01:44,310
replied his wife

43
00:01:45,010 --> 00:01:46,910
how can you be so tiresome?

44
00:01:47,910 --> 00:01:51,590
You must know that I am thinking
of his marrying one of them

45
00:01:52,550 --> 00:01:54,710
Is that his design in settling here?

46
00:01:55,690 --> 00:01:56,690
Design?

47
00:01:56,690 --> 00:01:57,690
Nonsense

48
00:01:57,850 --> 00:01:58,850
how can you talk so!

49
00:01:59,350 --> 00:02:02,770
But it is very likely that he
may fall in love with one of them

50
00:02:03,170 --> 00:02:06,510
and therefore you must visit
him as soon as he comes
